# game/ch06.rpy:12
translate english ch6_ccfd7dc8:

    # n "周五晚上，阿狐最喜欢的动画片周年庆，官方粉丝群炸开了锅。"
    n "Friday evening. The anniversary of Ahu's favorite animated show set the official fan group buzzing."

# game/ch06.rpy:13
translate english ch6_3b342e90:

    # n "一个头像是动画明星、昵称「官方福利君」的账号，在群里发起了「生日福利抽奖」。"
    n "An account with the show's star as its avatar, nicknamed \"Official Benefits\", launched a \"birthday giveaway\" in the group."

# game/ch06.rpy:15
translate english ch6_e16ad5f6:

    # think laugh "签名手办！官方发的福利，不抽白不抽！"
    think laugh "A signed figure! It's official — a free draw is a free draw!"

# game/ch06.rpy:18
translate english ch6_2ad06eee:

    # fraud serious "抽奖通道2小时后关闭，扫码从速！"
    fraud serious "The giveaway closes in 2 hours — scan now!"

# game/ch06.rpy:32
translate english ch6_A_ae8b278d:

    # n "阿狐盯着「扫码进群」四个字，突然想起老师反诈课上的提醒。"
    n "Staring at the words \"scan to join\", Ahu suddenly remembered his teacher's warning from the anti-fraud class."

# game/ch06.rpy:33
translate english ch6_A_c3903457:

    # think serious "老师说过，明星官方活动只会在官方账号和官方平台发布，群里突然冒出来的「官方福利」，多半是假的！"
    think serious "Teacher said official star events are only announced on official accounts and platforms. An \"official giveaway\" popping up in a fan group is almost always fake!"

# game/ch06.rpy:34
translate english ch6_A_86b776ee:

    # mc serious "真官方不会在粉丝群里拉人扫码抽奖，这个「福利君」是假冒的！"
    mc serious "The real team never pulls fans from group chats to scan codes. This \"Benefits\" account is a fake!"

# game/ch06.rpy:35
translate english ch6_A_e9a0d1be:

    # n "阿狐不仅退出群聊，还截图举报了该账号，提醒群里的小粉丝们别上当。"
    n "Ahu not only left the group — he screenshot-reported the account and warned the young fans not to fall for it."

# game/ch06.rpy:36
translate english ch6_A_6bc70373:

    # n "没过两天，群里真的有同学中了这种假抽奖的招，交了「邮费」却被拉黑。"
    n "Sure enough, two days later a classmate fell for the same fake giveaway — paid the \"postage\" and got blocked."

# game/ch06.rpy:39
translate english ch6_A_c3f021d6:

    # police laugh "警惕性满分！假冒「官方福利君」的骗子，最爱在粉丝群里用「免费抽奖」钓鱼。记住：真福利走官方渠道，群里扫码抽奖，一律是陷阱！"
    police laugh "Full marks for vigilance! Fake \"official benefit\" scammers love phishing in fan groups with \"free giveaways\". Remember: real perks come through official channels — QR-code giveaways in group chats are always traps!"

# game/ch06.rpy:51
translate english ch6_B_b13eb2af:

    # mc confused "官方抽奖不是在官方APP里吗？为什么要扫码加群呀？"
    mc confused "Isn't the official giveaway in the official APP? Why scan a code to join a group?"

# game/ch06.rpy:52
translate english ch6_B_a754cc19:

    # fraud laugh "这次福利太火爆，官方APP抢不到，所以开设了「内部抽奖群」！你是第38位幸运粉丝，概率超高哦！"
    fraud laugh "This event is so hot the official APP can't handle it, so we opened an \"insider giveaway group\"! You're lucky fan No.38 — the odds are super high!"

# game/ch06.rpy:53
translate english ch6_B_3ea43991:

    # n "对方发来几张「粉丝中奖晒单」和仿官方的「活动海报」，看着像模像样。"
    n "The scammer sent several \"winner posts\" and an imitation official poster. It all looked the part."

# game/ch06.rpy:54
translate english ch6_B_4884d8bd:

    # fraud serious "登记抽奖资格需要：家长手机号、身份证号，再扫脸认证，防止黄牛冒领。信息绝对保密！"
    fraud serious "To register you need: a parent's phone number, your ID number, plus a face scan to keep out scalpers. Totally confidential!"

# game/ch06.rpy:68
translate english ch6_B1_589f4452:

    # n "阿狐心里拿不准，拿着平板走到客厅找妈妈。"
    n "Unsure, Ahu carried his tablet to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch06.rpy:69
translate english ch6_B1_f699d790:

    # think worried "虽然好想要手办，但「扫脸认证」听起来有点吓人，还是先问问妈妈。"
    think worried "I really want that figure, but a \"face scan\" sounds scary. Ask Mom first."

# game/ch06.rpy:70
translate english ch6_B1_3199028c:

    # mc worried "妈妈，粉丝群有人办抽奖，要家长的手机号和身份证号，还要扫脸，是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, someone in the fan group is running a giveaway and wants a parent's phone number, my ID number, and a face scan. Is that real?"

# game/ch06.rpy:71
translate english ch6_B1_bfc1696b:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「粉丝福利」骗局！抽奖为什么要你的身份证和脸？那是拿去注册账号、开支付账户用的！真官方活动从来不需要这些。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"fan benefits\" scam! Why would a giveaway need your ID and face? They're used to register accounts and open payment accounts! Real official events never ask for these."

# game/ch06.rpy:72
translate english ch6_B1_2283e9f9:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报了账号。第二天，那个「福利君」果然因诈骗被平台封禁。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report the account. The next day, the \"Benefits\" account was indeed banned by the platform for fraud."

# game/ch06.rpy:75
translate english ch6_B1_48df3256:

    # police laugh "问得及时！身份证号和人脸信息是身份的「钥匙」，谁要都不能给。你守住了最重要的信息，非常棒！"
    police laugh "Great timing! Your ID number and face data are the \"keys\" to your identity — never give them to anyone. You protected the most important information. Excellent!"

# game/ch06.rpy:87
translate english ch6_B2_f779345e:

    # mc serious "抽个奖而已，凭什么要身份证号还要扫脸？这个我不参与。"
    mc serious "It's just a giveaway — why would it need my ID number and a face scan? Count me out."

# game/ch06.rpy:88
translate english ch6_B2_3aa278c6:

    # fraud serious "不登记就等于放弃资格！多少人排队想要名额呢，错过今天就没有了！"
    fraud serious "Not registering means giving up your spot! Tons of people are queuing for it — miss today and it's gone!"

# game/ch06.rpy:89
translate english ch6_B2_bb64b692:

    # think serious "越是不让犹豫、催得越紧的，越可疑。不填就是不填！"
    think serious "The harder they push and the less they let you think, the more suspicious it is. No means no!"

# game/ch06.rpy:90
translate english ch6_B2_56afc3c7:

    # n "阿狐退出群聊并举报。几天后，新闻里报道了同款「粉丝抽奖」骗局，专骗小朋友的身份证信息去注册网络账号。"
    n "Ahu left and reported it. Days later, the news covered the same \"fan giveaway\" scam — stealing kids' ID numbers to register online accounts."

# game/ch06.rpy:93
translate english ch6_B2_9c5bcc86:

    # police serious "守住身份证号和扫脸这一关，你就守住了身份安全！骗子拿不到你的身份信息，后面的骗局就演不下去了。"
    police serious "Guard your ID number and face data, and you guard your identity! Without your information, the rest of the scam can't play out."

# game/ch06.rpy:105
translate english ch6_B3_fc279552:

    # n "为了心爱的手办，阿狐按对方要求填了妈妈的手机号和自己的身份证号。"
    n "For the beloved figure, Ahu filled in Mom's phone number and his own ID number as instructed."

# game/ch06.rpy:106
translate english ch6_B3_10d0d1f9:

    # n "刚提交，对方又发来消息：扫脸认证失败，需缴纳30元「人工认证费」重新审核。"
    n "Right after submitting, another message: face verification failed — pay a 30-yuan \"manual review fee\" to retry."

# game/ch06.rpy:107
translate english ch6_B3_ff2eb4c4:

    # think serious "等等……怎么又冒出认证费？老师说过，抽奖要交钱就是诈骗！"
    think serious "Wait... where did this review fee come from? Teacher said any giveaway that charges money is a scam!"

# game/ch06.rpy:108
translate english ch6_B3_de4811b5:

    # mc serious "我不交钱了，你们是骗子！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. You're scammers!"

# game/ch06.rpy:109
translate english ch6_B3_b5daa449:

    # n "阿狐立刻告诉妈妈。妈妈马上修改了手机号关联的账户密码，并叮嘱身份证信息泄露可不是小事。"
    n "Ahu told Mom immediately. She changed the passwords linked to the phone number right away and warned him that leaked ID information is no small matter."

# game/ch06.rpy:112
translate english ch6_B3_c985cadc:

    # police serious "好险！身份证号和手机号已经泄露，骗子可能拿去注册账号甚至网贷。个人信息是底线，再心爱的奖品也不能拿信息去换！"
    police serious "That was close! The ID number and phone number are leaked — scammers could register accounts or even loans with them. Personal information is the bottom line; no prize is worth trading it for!"

# game/ch06.rpy:124
translate english ch6_C_5e0e18f9:

    # n "阿狐扫码进了「抽奖群」，满心期待。"
    n "Ahu scanned into the \"giveaway group\", full of hope."

# game/ch06.rpy:125
translate english ch6_C_2b50fb15:

    # think laugh "限量手办，我来了！"
    think laugh "Limited figure, here I come!"

# game/ch06.rpy:126
translate english ch6_C_ff117d60:

    # fraud laugh "恭喜！系统显示你中了三等奖：签名手办一套！价值588元哦！"
    fraud laugh "Congratulations! The system shows you've won Third Prize: a signed figure set worth 588 yuan!"

# game/ch06.rpy:127
translate english ch6_C_8228219b:

    # fraud serious "领取只需支付88元「粉丝会费+保价邮费」，付完48小时内发货！"
    fraud serious "To claim it, just pay an 88-yuan \"fan membership + insured shipping\" fee, and it ships within 48 hours!"

# game/ch06.rpy:141
translate english ch6_C1_7df21d9d:

    # n "手指悬在付款按钮上方，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "His finger hovered over the pay button — and Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch06.rpy:142
translate english ch6_C1_0866cf1e:

    # think serious "不对！免费抽奖，怎么领奖反而要我交钱？老师说过，先交钱的奖全是坑！"
    think serious "Wait! A free giveaway — why does claiming it cost me money? Teacher said prizes that charge first are all traps!"

# game/ch06.rpy:143
translate english ch6_C1_9f18efc5:

    # mc serious "手办我不要了！假冒官方骗粉丝的钱，我要举报你！"
    mc serious "Keep the figure! Impersonating the official team to cheat fans — I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch06.rpy:144
translate english ch6_C1_0739a7cf:

    # n "阿狐退出群聊、举报账号，还把骗局的截图发进班级群，提醒同学们别上当。"
    n "Ahu left the group, reported the account, and posted scam screenshots in the class group to warn his classmates."

# game/ch06.rpy:145
translate english ch6_C1_ad41e322:

    # n "老师特意在班会上表扬了他。"
    n "The teacher gave him a special shout-out at the class meeting."

# game/ch06.rpy:148
translate english ch6_C1_658edf8f:

    # police serious "用行动保护了全班同学，好样的！记住：天上不会掉手办，「免费抽奖」的背后，永远等着你先交钱。"
    police serious "Protecting the whole class with action — great job! Remember: figures don't fall from the sky. Behind every \"free giveaway\", someone waits for your payment."

# game/ch06.rpy:160
translate english ch6_C2_727675b7:

    # n "阿狐舍不得到手的「手办」，决定先付88元邮费。"
    n "Unable to let the \"figure\" go, Ahu decided to pay the 88-yuan fee first."

# game/ch06.rpy:161
translate english ch6_C2_766f58c4:

    # think laugh "88元换588元的手办，值！"
    think laugh "88 yuan for a 588-yuan figure? Worth it!"

# game/ch06.rpy:162
translate english ch6_C2_e3aa7089:

    # n "付款成功，对方却又发来消息：手办是海外限量版，需再缴150元「清关费」，否则包裹销毁。"
    n "Payment succeeded — then another message: the figure is an overseas limited edition, so a 150-yuan \"customs fee\" is needed, or the package will be destroyed."

# game/ch06.rpy:163
translate english ch6_C2_f11a7b9c:

    # mc confused "又来一项收费？这手办到底还发不发货？"
    mc confused "Another fee? Is this figure ever going to ship?"

# game/ch06.rpy:164
translate english ch6_C2_9abb336b:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈判断这是连环收费骗局，88元已无法追回，账号也注销拉黑了。"
    n "Ahu told Mom. She judged it a chain-fee scam — the 88 yuan was unrecoverable, and the account was deleted and blocked."

# game/ch06.rpy:167
translate english ch6_C2_38eaf9be:

    # police serious "「免费抽奖」实为「付费陷阱」：会费、邮费、清关费……名目层出不穷。记住：凡是中奖后还要交钱的，果断抽身别恋战！"
    police serious "The \"free giveaway\" is a \"paid trap\": membership, postage, customs... the fees never stop. Remember: once a \"win\" demands more money, cut your losses and walk away!"

# game/ch06.rpy:179
translate english ch6_C3_1a532eec:

    # n "阿狐怕手办「飞了」，先付88元会费邮费，又付150元「清关费」，接着按对方要求交了200元「未成年认证解冻金」……"
    n "Afraid the figure would \"fly away\", Ahu paid the 88-yuan fee, then 150 yuan \"customs\", then a 200-yuan \"minor verification unfreezing fee\" as demanded..."

# game/ch06.rpy:180
translate english ch6_C3_08b6da7c:

    # n "三天过去，手办毫无音讯。阿狐再去问，聊天框只剩刺眼的红色感叹号——他被拉黑，「抽奖群」也解散了。"
    n "Three days passed with no sign of the figure. When Ahu asked again, the chat showed only glaring red exclamation marks — he'd been blocked, and the \"giveaway group\" was dissolved."

# game/ch06.rpy:181
translate english ch6_C3_2ebf5d99:

    # mc sad "我的零花钱……全喂了骗子……"
    mc sad "All my allowance... fed to scammers..."

# game/ch06.rpy:182
translate english ch6_C3_7b885c04:

    # n "阿狐哭着向妈妈坦白，妈妈安慰他后立刻报警。"
    n "Ahu confessed to Mom through tears. She comforted him and reported to the police at once."

# game/ch06.rpy:183
translate english ch6_C3_92fc3007:

    # mom normal "手办以后还能攒钱买，教训记住了就好。真官方活动不收费，收费的「福利」都是骗局。"
    mom normal "You can save up for a figure later; as long as the lesson sticks, it's fine. Real official events are free — any \"benefit\" that charges is a scam."

# game/ch06.rpy:186
translate english ch6_C3_d562737d:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「粉丝福利」骗局专挑喜欢明星动画的同学下手：假官方、假抽奖、假中奖，最后全是真收钱。追星要理智，掏钱要三思！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! \"Fan benefit\" scams target kids who love stars and anime: fake officials, fake giveaways, fake wins — but real charges. Stay rational as a fan, and think twice before paying!"

