# game/ch06.rpy:14
translate english ch6_fce73724:

    # fraud laugh "周年庆福利来啦！扫码进抽奖群，免费抽签名周边、限量手办、生日会门票，100%%中奖，仅限今天！"
    fraud laugh "Anniversary benefits are here! Scan to join the giveaway group — free draw for signed merch, limited figures, and event tickets! 100%% win rate, today only!"

